        "correct": false,
        "why": "It does not."
      },
      {
        "text": "So the disk held still",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right."
      },
      {
        "text": "To give vm1 a new MAC address first",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "vm1 kept its MAC."
      },
      {
        "text": "To save electricity",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Not the reason."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ex-pamp9d59",
    "version": 1,
    "section": "what-a-copy-keeps",
    "type": "quiz",
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "drillable": true,
    "prompt": "vm2's card had no address at all. Why?",
    "hint": "The netplan file.",
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "Its network config matched vm1's MAC",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. So nothing configured the new card."
      },
      {
        "text": "The DHCP server refused a clone",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "vm2 never even asked."
      },
      {
        "text": "vm2 had no network card",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It had enp1s0."
      },
      {
        "text": "Two guests cannot share a network",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "web1 and web2 did."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ex-ag2zt6kk",
    "version": 1,
    "section": "what-a-copy-keeps",
    "type": "quiz",
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "drillable": true,
    "prompt": "How did the host learn vm2's hostname with vm2 off the network?",
